Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:17.71,Main,,0,0,0,,"The left side and the right side\Nof that country didn't get along,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,so they built a wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,and agreed not to have\Ndealings with each other."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:38.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think this is pointless, Madam Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:41.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by pointless?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.88,0:00:46.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Those on the two sides of the wall\Nreally do not get along,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,and do not want to see each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.25,0:00:51.46,Main,,0,0,0,,But the wall itself is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't want to lose to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Even with this pointless wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:01:01.13,Main,,0,0,0,,we want to brag that\Nwe are better on this side, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.13,0:01:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you have any ideas for\Nwhat we could do, Madam Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:07.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:09.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Mr. Official, do you have a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:16.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.63,0:01:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:32.83,Main,,0,0,0,,"This side of the country is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,By the Witch of the Travels."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:36.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,This wall represents the\Nseparation between the two sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:46.25,Main,,0,0,0,,but it also represents how\Nthis side is wonderful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.25,0:01:53.67,Main,,0,0,0,,So you should have travelers who\Nvisit carve words into the wall like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:55.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The more words you have on this side,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:59.83,Main,,0,0,0,,the clearer it is that this side is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:02.67,Main,,0,0,0,,But I don't really like doing things that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.67,0:02:04.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,on the other side of the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,many travelers have already left their marks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,"After that, I went to\Nthe other side of the wall..."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:20.63,Main,,0,0,0,,on the other side of the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.63,0:02:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,many travelers have already left their marks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.04,0:02:25.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,"...and told them the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:29.46,Main,,0,0,0,,"This side of the country is great."\N"By the Witch of the Travels"\N"...and told them the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,"This side of the country is great."\N"By the Witch of the Travels"\NSince then, it became custom for\Nall travelers who visit that country
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.63,0:02:33.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Since then, it became custom for\Nall travelers who visit that country
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,to etch words into that wall."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.67,0:04:16.00,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Wall Etched by Travelers"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:20.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What was the point in having\Ntravelers carve words into the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:22.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:25.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was like a popularity contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:26.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Popularity contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,They want to brag that they're better
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,than the people on the other side of the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:35.79,Main,,0,0,0,,To be able to say that there are\Nmore words on their side praising them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:40.13,Main,,0,0,0,,So then, in the end, which side was better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Which side of the wall had more words on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:46.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll have to go see with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:47.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.67,Main,,0,0,0,,When I become a witch and travel...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:55.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:56.63,Main,,0,0,0,,"This country's the best!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:04:59.46,Main,,0,0,0,,"I've never been to such a great country!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,"We'll be getting married soon!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:05.21,Main,,0,0,0,,"Best traveling buds forever."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:08.04,Main,,0,0,0,,"Friends forever!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:15.17,Main,,0,0,0,,"This country is as great as our muscles."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me, but...\N"This country is as great as our muscles."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:19.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the witch from the\NUnited Magic Association, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Saya, the Charcoal Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.71,0:05:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I've heard about this wall,\Nbut it really is amazing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You can really see how many\Npeople have visited this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Our request for you is to do\Nsomething about this wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:42.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:45.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been more than ten years\Nsince a traveling witch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:49.00,Main,,0,0,0,,suggested we have visitors\Netch messages into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But recently, people have been losing interest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,so we want to do something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Something new, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:06:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It already seems pretty great to me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:06.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The wall etched by travelers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Traveler?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:14.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Mister! Can I borrow a knife, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:16.50,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:21.83,Main,,0,0,0,,...ve Mi... na... lo... Ela...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I ...ove ...iss ...lain... I love Miss Elaina...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:35.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina... Miss Elaina... Miss Elaina...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:41.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This wall isn't a place for you\Nto carve your carnal desires!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}you {\i0}saying, Mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:46.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This is very important!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:48.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What's so important about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,This wall is here for travelers to\Ncarve how wonderful this country is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:55.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, about that rule--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.13,0:06:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try changing it starting today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Starting today, make it so the people\Nof this country can also carve into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,They can carve their passionate\Nfeelings about the person they like,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:08.83,Main,,0,0,0,,or their hopes for the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:11.13,Main,,0,0,0,,or "I love Miss Elaina!" or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the reason for doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:19.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? I mean, you're the ones\Nwho made this wall, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,So shouldn't it be here for your sakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Turn it from a wall for travelers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:33.63,Main,,0,0,0,,into a wall that will help you\Nfix your eyes straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:36.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:38.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.25,0:07:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:41.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:44.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got a job on the\Nother side of the wall, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:03.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Why was my heart swelling\Nwith expectation on that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:04.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The answer is--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:09.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I was about to visit the country\Nwith words etched into its wall
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:14.13,Main,,0,0,0,,that appeared in The Adventures of Niké,\Na book that influenced me greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no wall here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome! Cheap wall pieces for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,How about some mementos of your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't just debris!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:27.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It's debris from the famous wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,--No, it {\i1}is {\i0}just debris...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,--It's rare! Rare!\N--No, it {\i1}is {\i0}just debris...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:32.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're the traveling witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.67,0:08:34.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been what, more than ten years?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:38.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:40.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Your face looks younger than back then...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:42.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Looking carefully, your chest is different, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:47.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What, you're not her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:49.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, are you two officials in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Or are you just regular wrinkly old men?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.83,0:09:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,We are indeed officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,But we are also wrinkly old men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, this is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you tell me why you tore down the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the explanation I was given--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,At the advice of a witch who visited\Nthis country a little before I had,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:19.46,Main,,0,0,0,,"I love you! Forever!"\NAt the advice of a witch who visited\Nthis country a little before I had,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,"I love you! Forever!"\Nthe people of this country started\Ncarving whatever they wanted on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:22.96,Main,,0,0,0,,"I hate that guy"\Nthe people of this country started\Ncarving whatever they wanted on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,"The king has donkey ears"\Nthe people of this country started\Ncarving whatever they wanted on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:24.71,MainTop,,0,0,0,,At first, they were happy with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:26.33,MainTop,,0,0,0,,At first, they were happy with that,\N"I am a fallen angel appearing\Nfrom the deepest darkness"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:27.33,MainTop,,0,0,0,,At first, they were happy with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:30.79,MainTop,,0,0,0,,but as days and then weeks passed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What does forever mean, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:33.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We already broke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:37.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I wrote something crazy when I was drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.58,0:09:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,--What the hell? Who wrote\Nthese insults about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:41.17,Main,,0,0,0,,--People say, "What happens\Non a trip, stays on a trip."\N--What the hell? Who wrote\Nthese insults about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:45.25,Main,,0,0,0,,--But the words etched by the people\Nof the country stayed with them,\N--What {\i1}is {\i0}this? It's so embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,and became embarrassing memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.79,0:10:00.13,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, they decided to tear down the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Before they knew it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:04.88,Main,,0,0,0,,the resentment they felt toward\Nthe people on the other side
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.88,0:10:07.29,Main,,0,0,0,,didn't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:13.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Before, everyone thought they were better\Nthan those on the other side of the wall--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:17.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But with the embarrassing\Nthings they wrote themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:19.42,Main,,0,0,0,,they realized that wasn't the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,In the end, this country didn't need a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We were all the same in every way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,From now on, I suppose we will live\Npeacefully in our ordinary country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:31.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:34.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, Madam Witch. Please excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:35.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Um--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Before the wall was torn down,\Nwhich side had more praises etched into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:43.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.71,0:10:45.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It was the same for both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.96,0:10:47.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The same?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:50.08,Main,,0,0,0,,We started off as the same country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,And we all worked hard\Nso we wouldn't lose to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:57.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you realize
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:11:01.42,Main,,0,0,0,,that the same growth was\Nhappening on the other side of the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to convince\Nourselves that we were better,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,we didn't want to look on\Nthe other side of the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:09.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that went for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:14.21,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"This side of the country is great."\N"By the Witch of the Travels"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.79,0:11:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this worked out for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:22.29,Main,,0,0,0,,A country isn't for tourists or travelers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:25.38,Main,,0,0,0,,but for those who live there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It's too bad I couldn't see the wall, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:33.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Niké carved those words
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:35.88,Main,,0,0,0,,thinking the wall would be gone in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:38.25,Main,,0,0,0,,No, there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.25,0:11:42.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Cute witch, how about a piece\Nof the wall as a souvenir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:47.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose as a memento,\NI'll take... this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Please come again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:58.71,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Elai..."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Elai...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:22.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, this year's grapes look\Nlike they're ripening well, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:25.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll make delicious wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:27.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Step, step...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.67,0:12:31.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wear this for the\NGrape-Throwing Festival that's coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.67,0:12:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:41.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandpa, how did the\NGrape-Throwing Festival start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:44.71,Main,,0,0,0,,How? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:49.67,Main,,0,0,0,,A long, long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:54.92,Main,,0,0,0,,when this village was still split\Ninto That Village and This Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.96,Main,,0,0,0,,and all we did was fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:13:04.33,Main,,0,0,0,,a witch came to visit during the grape harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:10.54,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Grape-Stomping Girl"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:15.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome to This Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,"This Village"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.88,0:13:20.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! Our village is called "This Village,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:24.92,Main,,0,0,0,,and on the other side\Nof the road is "That Village."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.92,0:13:29.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The two villages, This and That,\Nare famous for wine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed! Wine is a local specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam Witch, do you like wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:37.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never had any.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:44.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted my first taste of alcohol\Nto be something very delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:49.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Then, you were\Nright to come to This Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.50,0:13:50.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The wine from This Village is so delicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.63,Main,,0,0,0,,the wine from That Village\Nand elsewhere cannot compare!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:56.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It is truly a wine made by God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.71,Main,,0,0,0,,It's that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,So, is that the wine you boast of?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:03.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Gulp! No, it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This wine is from That Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:13.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's outrageous!\NThat Village has started doing {\i1}this{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,"Grape-stomping maiden,\NRosemary, from That Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:21.92,Main,,0,0,0,,'I lovingly stepped on the grapes.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:25.79,Main,,0,0,0,,With this wonderful label\Nof the lovely Rosemary,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:28.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That Village is increasing their sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,And they make it seem like Rosemary\Nis the place of origin of the wine--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,"Place of origin"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:36.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.67,0:14:39.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Not the manufacturer, but the place of origin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:43.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Because making her the place of\Norigin will tempt people to buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,"Tempt"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.75,0:14:51.75,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words, appealing to fetishes\Nis also important in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:54.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh, so it's selling well, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Just because a cute girl\Nis stepping lovingly on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.04,0:15:00.17,Main,,0,0,0,,"Stepping lovingly"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, why doesn't This Village\Ntry competing with them
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:08.25,Main,,0,0,0,,by getting a cute girl to do\Nthe, "stepping lovingly" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:10.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Well said!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:12.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what we should do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:14.79,Main,,0,0,0,,If we get a sweet maiden\Nto step lovingly on our grapes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.79,0:15:17.13,Main,,0,0,0,,then we can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,So, Madam Witch, will you do the honors?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:22.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:28.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody! Madam Witch said\Nshe'll step lovingly on our grapes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe such a cute witch\Nwill step lovingly on our grapes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Step on me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,--Um, what am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,--Hurry up and get ready!\N--Um, what am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:43.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to wear this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.17,0:16:00.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Grape-stomping maidens\Nmust all wear these clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:03.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It makes them more tempting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.21,0:16:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,"Tempting"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:07.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Ready, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:14.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what might you be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello, Chief of This Village that's dying out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:24.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You...! The shiningly beautiful Rosemary!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:27.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Rosemary...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.17,0:16:30.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? What might that bottle\Nyou're holding to your chest be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:31.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Gulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:34.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Might it be wine from my label?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Could you be a fan of mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,F-Fan? O-Of course not...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I can sign the label if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:46.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sign?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:53.83,Main,,0,0,0,,And? Who in the world is this undersized\Ngirl in grape-stomping maiden clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:55.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a traveling witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:58.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? A witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:02.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. You can't beat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:07.75,Main,,0,0,0,,so you're planning to have this\Nthin girl step lovingly on some grapes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:09.42,Main,,0,0,0,,"Thin," you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Her face is just okay, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:14.63,Main,,0,0,0,,"Just okay"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Her figure is like that of a child's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:19.67,Main,,0,0,0,,"Like a child's"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:23.04,Main,,0,0,0,,No, not "{\i1}like {\i0}a child"--she {\i1}is {\i0}a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:29.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't beat me by having a child\Nlike this step lovingly on grapes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:31.13,Main,,0,0,0,,--Well then, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:33.46,Main,,0,0,0,,--Step! Step! Step! Step!\N--Well then, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:37.58,Main,,0,0,0,,--Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:40.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Chief, I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:41.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I will be the grape-stomping maiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:47.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:18:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,--Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!\N--Step! Step! Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:06.04,Main,,0,0,0,,--Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!\N--Step... Step... Step... Step...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:09.29,Main,,0,0,0,,--Die! Die! Die! Die! Die! Die!\N--Step! Step! Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:17.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm beat...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam Witch, good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like I stomped a lot of grapes today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:26.46,Main,,0,0,0,,How much wine do you think it'll make?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see... maybe about half a cask?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it? Even though I stomped that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so hard being a grape-stomping maiden...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,How much of that wine is being sold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,A lot! Hundreds, maybe\Neven thousands of bottles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to say that Rosemary is\Nstomping grapes from morning until night
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:58.17,Main,,0,0,0,,to make that many bottles of wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.17,0:19:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:09.96,Main,,0,0,0,,--Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:12.96,Main,,0,0,0,,--Step harder on those grapes.\N--Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,--Don't you want to sell\Nwine with my label on it?\N--Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:17.83,Main,,0,0,0,,--Come on! Come on!\N--Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.21,0:19:23.42,Main,,0,0,0,,--What in the world...\N--Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,--The wine wasn't lovingly\Nstepped on by Rosemary...!\N--Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:30.46,Main,,0,0,0,,--Well, it's obvious now.\N--Step! Step! Step! Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:31.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Then--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:41.54,Main,,0,0,0,,This means the point of\Norigin is fraudulent, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:44.58,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a case that could be brought to court!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.79,0:19:47.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Step...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:48.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We're found out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We were selling so many, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It's kind of amazing we weren't\Nfound out until now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:20:01.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Rosemary's wine... was stomped\Nby those strong men over there...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.25,0:20:05.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal\Nabout lying about the origin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.67,0:20:07.25,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no difference once you drink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:12.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. It's my first time drinking wine,\Nbut it really is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:14.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What's important are the feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if it tastes the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,it was important for it to\Nbe stepped on by Rosemary...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's... That's what fetishism is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:29.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't complain about Rosemary!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:30.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.17,0:20:32.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:34.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to our chief?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.79,0:20:56.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, really, what am I to do with you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,And then? And then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:21.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone took those grape bullets...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,...and was knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,By the time we woke up,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,the witch had already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,And that's the story of how\Nthe Grape-Throwing Festival began.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a good way to release stress,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.13,0:21:52.83,Main,,0,0,0,,so it became tradition\Nto have it during the harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:57.79,Main,,0,0,0,,And before we knew it, the two villages\Nhad stopped fighting and become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:01.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? Then we need to thank that witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.58,0:22:03.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Rosemary?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:11.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,That's?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:17.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a story for another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time we had lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Go wash your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.33,0:22:22.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.92,0:22:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Really, ripening well...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.42,0:22:29.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempting me no matter how old...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.75,0:22:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, good work! Let's have lunch now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:35.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
